# SkydeityMysticPivot - xuanshu crystal cluster, 10 prisms / flat 16x16 palette (batch 79)
# every prism: slightly tapering foot -> gently wider waist -> body -> short tip
# batch 77: waist pulled back in (x1.9~2.0 the top ring) so it reads as crystal, not a cone
# batch 79: a few prisms lean a little more crooked (tilt 19~27 deg) for a natural askew cluster
# no rock base; no vertical gradient; every face wound outward
mtllib crystal_cluster.mtl
usemtl crystal
